stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Accepted
    Accepted --> Running: work starts
    Accepted --> Interrupted: start or lease timeout
    Running --> Completed: workflow finished
    Running --> Partial: incomplete execution
    Running --> Failed: unrecoverable error
    Running --> Interrupted: compute or lease lost
    Accepted --> CancelRequested: cancel
    Running --> CancelRequested: cancel
    CancelRequested --> Cancelled: stopped or lease expired
    Interrupted --> Running: resume with new attempt
    Interrupted --> Cancelled: cancel
    Completed --> [*]
    Partial --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]
